//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Kassahi rejuv display rules (rvl/rvs)
// Mirrors upstream Kassahi `01-utility-items[ALL]:14-17`. The variant alias files
// (`02-alias/03-alias-kassahi-{normal,hyper,luxe,mystery-*}.filter`) rename rvl
// upstream of this file (with %CONTINUE%) to "° Juice °" / "+ Full +" — this file
// is the terminal display so the renamed value actually renders.
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ItemDisplay[FILTLVL<7 rvs]: %PURPLE%° %WHITE%35%
ItemDisplay[rvs]:
ItemDisplay[rvl]: %NAME%
